{"id":"vod_jy_39665","vodId":"39665","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"轻音少女","name_cn":"轻音少女","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第14集","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/831979cdc82239bb411794d618b7cfbb.jpg"},"summary":"樱丘高中的新学期开始了，这不仅仅意味着有许多新的面孔将出现在校园里，同时也意味着，一场轰轰烈烈的社团招募大战即将拉开帷幕。天然呆少女平泽唯（丰崎爱生暂无内容配音）对新的校园生活有着一份憧憬但也心怀忐忑，这时一个大大咧咧的女孩田井中律（佐藤聪美暂无内容配音）出现在了她的面前。在阿律的热情邀请下，有些迟钝的小唯莫名其妙的成为了“轻音部”的吉他手。来到轻音部活动室的小唯见到了贝斯手秋山澪（日笠阳子暂无内容配音），这个有些正经但又有些害羞的黑长直让小唯心生好感。但这时小唯才发现，这个传说中的轻音部，所有的社团居然就是她们三人，而按照学校的规定，凡是不满四人的社团就要被解散。怎么办？刚刚加入社团的小唯，立刻要开始为了保证社团不被解散而开始奋斗！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-12-28 17:45:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dN7XANe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/5eVJoGOe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Qe1VEZGa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/9b6YG1za/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/neg78oDe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/penG7yPa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/9avmR0Me/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/9aA8WZpe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QdJEzpvb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/YaOJLxQe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/NbWWpVnb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/rb2G2MWd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xe7DYROa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/lejA51Bd/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T11:56:50.079Z"}